{"about_the_game":"**From Berk Kalfa, founder &amp; developer of Hittite Games**<br />\r\n**DOOM DRIVE \u2013 No Rules. No Mercy**<br />\r\n**Zombie Destruction Simulator**: Drive in an open world and crush mutant and city zombies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n### Key Features<br />\r\n- \ud83d\udd2a **Unlimited Zombie Destruction**  <br />\r\n  Crush everything from mutant hordes to hulking city zombies without limits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f **Open World Driving**  <br />\r\n  Explore freely in cars, buses, and motorcycles\u2014each vehicle offers its own thrill.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- \ud83d\udca5 **Devastating Weapon Variety**  <br />\r\n  Trigger physics-based explosions and use strategic range to blow zombies sky-high.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- \ud83e\uddec **Extensive Character Customization**  <br />\r\n  Build your hero from hundreds of appearance and gear combinations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- \ud83c\udf0d **Realistic Physics &amp; Visuals**  <br />\r\n  Experience dynamic vehicle handling, fully destructible environments, and detailed zombie models.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt; Survive the apocalypse with the \u201cNo Rules. No Mercy\u201d mindset\u2014try **Doom Drive** today!  <br />\r\n&gt; \ud83d\udc49 **Add to your Wishlist** and prepare to outlast the undead!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729780?t=1756071515","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729780/5205ba943e14dc67ecd8b075fd5a8b1bd130a6a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756071515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729780/7d428414fb4e74c924c6e5774690cb8f9c2ff030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756071515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729780/7d428414fb4e74c924c6e5774690cb8f9c2ff030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756071515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri